<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - British Sky raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - British Sky raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it raised British Sky Broadcasting Group Plc to intermediate-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said the long-term rating remains accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
